Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: ou-admin-api
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.11), libmariadb3, libsystemd0, uwsgi-plugin-python3, uwsgi-core, sudo
Recommends: nginx, redis-server
Conflicts: grommunio-admin-api
Replaces: grommunio-admin-api
Provides: grommunio-admin-api
Description: Admin REST API and CLI for Gromox (Office Unbound build, no user cap)
 Domain/user/mailbox management API (uwsgi) and the grommunio-admin CLI.
 Patched for Office Unbound: the 5-user licence cap and the vendor licence
 portal call-home are removed and user-visible strings are rebranded (see
 patches in the source package). Python dependencies are installed from a
 hash-locked requirements file into /usr/lib/ou-admin-api/site-packages
 (never into the system python); the list is in the package SBOM.
 Note: this build does not include the pyexmdb binding (libexmdbpp), so
 operations that need direct EXMDB access are unavailable until that
 component has a recipe.
